# trivy allowlist — accepted / triaged CVEs (OWASP LLM03).
#
# A build fails on any un-listed HIGH/CRITICAL. To accept one, add its ID below
# with a one-line justification and, ideally, a review date. An accepted CVE that
# later gets an upstream fix is picked up by `ignore-unfixed` and re-fails — that
# is the regression mechanism (a new/real finding always breaks the build).
#
# Format: one CVE ID per line, e.g.
#   CVE-2024-XXXXX  # <why it's acceptable / not exploitable here> — reviewed 2026-08-05
#
# (empty — no accepted findings yet)
